s x1isl5vh xn8zj9a x148chh3"><span dir="auto" class="x140p0ai x1gufx9m x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1lliihq x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xfjzk2p xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px; --x-8dd7yt: -0.0137em; --x-hxtmnb: 0.0137em;">domingo</span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6"><div tabindex="-1" class="" role="row"><div tabindex="-1" class="_amjv xa0aww2" data-id="false_5521992837178@c.us_3EB032E20A4C9BC7889DE1"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" data-virtualized="false" style=""><div class=""><div class="message-in focusable-list-item _amjy _amjz _amjw x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div class="_amk4 false _amkd _amk5 false"><span aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tail-in" class="_amk7"><svg viewBox="0 0 8 13" height="13" width="8" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" version="1.1" x="0px" y="0px" enable-background="new 0 0 8 13"><title>tail-in</title><path opacity="0.13" fill="#0000000" d="M1.533,3.568L8,12.193V1H2.812 C1.042,1,0.474,2.156,1.533,3.568z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M1.533,2.568L8,11.193V0L2.812,0C1.042,0,0.474,1.156,1.533,2.568z"></path></svg></span><div class="_amk6 _amlo false false"><span aria-label="Matheus Nascimento Vitrinne:"></span><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xizg8k xu9hqtb xwib8y2"><div class="copyable-text" data-pre-plain-text="[16:45, 11/01/2026] Matheus Nascimento Vitrinne: "><div class="_akbu x6ikm8r x10wlt62"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="ltr" class="x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu _ao3e _aupe copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;"><span class="x1lliihq">Create a cinematic video with a pure black background and absolute darkness.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">A man inspired by the reference photos stands facing directly toward the camera, centered in the frame. He is completely covered by shadows, with no visible facial details, skin texture, eyes, or clothing.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">Only his solid black silhouette is visible. The silhouette must remain fully dark at all times, without highlights, rim light, reflections, or light spill.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">The man raises a vape and exhales smoke. The smoke is visible, but it does NOT illuminate the man, does NOT reveal his face, and does NOT create light interaction with his body.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">The smoke appears as a soft, semi-transparent gray shape floating in the darkness, existing independently from the silhouette.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
