</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">A man based on the reference photos stands directly facing the camera, perfectly centered. He is entirely swallowed by darkness, with zero visible details — no facial features, no skin, no eyes, no clothing, no texture of any kind.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">The character is visible only as a solid, opaque black silhouette. This silhouette must remain 100% unlit at all times, with no highlights, no rim lighting, no reflections, and no light leakage.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">The man lifts a vape and exhales an overwhelming, excessive volume of smoke. The smoke is extremely dense, thick, continuous, and heavy, far beyond realistic amounts, immediately forming a thick fog / mist.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
