rate a cinematic video set in complete blackness, with a pure black background and no visible environment.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">A man based on the reference photos starts standing directly facing the camera, perfectly centered, deep inside a dense fog of smoke. He is entirely swallowed by darkness, with zero visible details — no facial features, no skin, no eyes, no clothing, no texture of any kind.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">The character is visible only as a solid, opaque black silhouette. This silhouette must remain 100% unlit at all times, with no highlights, no rim lighting, no reflections, and no light leakage.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="">The man lifts a vape and exhales an overwhelming, excessive volume of smoke. The smoke is extremely dense, thick, continuous, and heavy, far beyond realistic amounts, immediately formi…</span></span><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="xuxw1ft x1ypdohk x1rg5ohu xo1mcw5 x1xlr1w8 x1hl2dhg xt0b8zv xbvygy2 x17f7hit xp30eni xhmieyt read-more-button"> Ler mais</div><span class=""><span class="x3nfvp2 xxymvpz xlshs6z xqtp20y xexx8yu x1uc92m x18d9i69 x181vq82 x12lo8hy x152skdk" aria-hidden="true"><span class="x1c4vz4f x2lah0s">17:09</span></span></span></div></div><div class="x1n2onr6 x1n327nk x18mqm2i xhsvlbd x14z9mp xz62fqu x1wbi8v6"><div class="x1bvqhpb xx3o462 xuxw1ft x78zum5 x6s0dn4 x12lo8hy x152skdk"><span class="x1rg5ohu x16dsc37" dir="auto"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px;">17:09</span></span></div></div></div></div><span class=""></span><div class="x10l6tqk xyc4j8s xceh6e4"></div></div><div class="x1c4vz4f xs83m0k xdl72j9 x1g77sc7 x78zum5 xozqiw3 x1oa3qoh x12fk4p8 xeuugli x2lwn1j x1nhvcw1 x1q0g3np x6s0dn4 _amj_"><div class="x1c4vz4f xs83m0k xdl72j9 x1g77sc7 xeuugli x2lwn1j xozqiw3 x1oa3qoh x12fk4p8 xexx8yu x1im30kd x18d9i69 x1djpfga"><div></div></div></div></div><div class="x78zum5 xbfrwjf x8k05lb xeq5yr9 x1n2onr6 xrr41r3 xqcrz7y"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div tabindex="-1" class="" role="row"><div tabindex="-1" class="_amjv xscbp6u" data-id="false_5521992837178@c.us_3EB080BF8995B821DEA852"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" data-virtualized="false"><div class=""><div class="message-in focusable-list-item _amjy _amjz _amjw x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div class="_amk4 false _amkv false"><div class="_amk6 _amlo false false"><span aria-label="Matheus Nascimento Vitrinne:"></span><div><div class="x9f619 xlkrthq x1n2onr6 x1vjfegm xyqdw3p x1im30kd xg8j3zb x1djpfga"><div role="button" tabi