false_5521992837178@c.us_3EB0D6580CB618F314FE69"><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf" data-virtualized="false"><div class=""><div class="message-in focusable-list-item _amjy _amjz _amjw x1klvx2g xahtqtb"><span class=""></span><div class="_amk4 false _amkd _amk5 false"><span aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tail-in" class="_amk7"><svg viewBox="0 0 8 13" height="13" width="8" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" version="1.1" x="0px" y="0px" enable-background="new 0 0 8 13"><title>tail-in</title><path opacity="0.13" fill="#0000000" d="M1.533,3.568L8,12.193V1H2.812 C1.042,1,0.474,2.156,1.533,3.568z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M1.533,2.568L8,11.193V0L2.812,0C1.042,0,0.474,1.156,1.533,2.568z"></path></svg></span><div class="_amk6 _amlo false false"><span aria-label="Matheus Nascimento Vitrinne:"></span><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xizg8k xu9hqtb xwib8y2"><div class="copyable-text" data-pre-plain-text="[06:40, 12/01/2026] Matheus Nascimento Vitrinne: "><div class="_akbu x6ikm8r x10wlt62"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="ltr" class="x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu _ao3e _aupe copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;"><span class="x1lliihq">Generate a cinematic video set in complete blackness, with a pure black background and no visible environment.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">A man based on the reference photos starts standing directly facing the camera, perfectly centered, deep inside a dense fog of smoke.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">At the beginning, he is entirely swallowed by darkness, with zero visible details — no facial features, no skin, no eyes, no clothing, no texture of any kind.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">He is visible only as a solid, opaque black silhouette, fully unlit, with no highlights, rim light, reflections, or light leakage.
</span><span class="x1lliihq">
</span><span class="x1lliihq">The man lifts a vape and exhales an overwhelming, excessive volume of smoke. The smoke is extremely dense, thick, continuous, and heavy, forming a thick fog / mist that fills the entire frame and dominates the image.
